### ===================================================================
### AI BACKEND & MODEL READINESS HEALTH CHECKS
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@directAiUrl = http://localhost:8001
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Check AI Health via Main Backend Gateway
# Expected: 200 OK, model_loaded: true, input_shape: [12, 8], risk_count: 7
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/health
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2. Check AI Backend directly (FastAPI on Port 8001)
# Expected: 200 OK, status: healthy
GET {{directAiUrl}}/health
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 3. Fetch AI Backend OpenAPI Schema directly
GET {{directAiUrl}}/openapi.json
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
